  "equipment_policy": "New eligible humanoid monsters only; persist each spawn decision including empty results. Ordinary dates use one whole-set acceptance/material roll for empty slots. From the second blood moon, blood dates independently roll acceptance and material for each empty slot; mixed materials and missing pieces are allowed. Preserve fixed sets, explicit equipment, drop rates and source generated quality/wear/enchantments. First blood date preserves legacy materials and partial armor.",
  "ordinary_held_probability": "(40 + 5 * ordinaryProgress) / 100",
  "blood_held_probability": "(70 + 3 * stage) / 100",
  "held_equipment_policy": "Applicable melee humanoids with an empty main hand only; preserve existing weapons and ranged mobs. Draw held-equipment acceptance separately from armor. Prefer the first armor piece newly filled in head/chest/legs/feet order, otherwise recognize existing armor, otherwise draw an independent material. Sword, pickaxe, shovel and axe have equal type weights; leather/chain tiers fall back to rusted iron tools.",
